message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "PyKeithley_SMU2450: Python control of the Keithley 2450 SourceMeter"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for controlling the Keithley 2450 SourceMeter (SMU)
  over Ethernet using TSP commands on a raw TCP socket — no VISA or vendor
  drivers required. Covers voltage/current sourcing with compliance
  limits, 2- and 4-wire sensing, linear I-V sweeps with buffer readout,
  source readback, trigger control, and Van der Pauw current-source
  configuration, with a command-line interface and a hardware
  verification script.
type: software
